<title>EL SALVADOR: SOCCER-VENEZUELA BEAT EL SALVADOR IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-VENEZUELA BEAT EL SALVADOR IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>SAN SALVADOR 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuela beat El Salvador</p>
<p>1-0 (halftime 0-0) in a friendly soccer international on</p>
<p>Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorer - Rafael Castellin (69th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 6,000</p>
</text>
